abs is a function, which only works for integers and returns an int.
(man 3 abs). You want to use fabs:

#include <iostream.h>
#include <math.h>

main()
{
 double a,b;

  a = 1e-3;
  if (fabs(a-b) > 1e-10)
     cout << fabs(a-b) << endl;
}

(Don't forget -lm at link time!)
